1
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:40,666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

2
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:51,927
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

3
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:29,690
I trust you'll like it in the West.

4
00:02:29,691 --> 00:02:30,859
You're welcome here.

5
00:02:51,713 --> 00:02:55,342
Starting from here,
I will accompany Her Majesty's carriage.

6
00:03:07,521 --> 00:03:09,313
It could be
because he's the king now,

7
00:03:09,314 --> 00:03:10,816
but he looks more dashing than ever.

8
00:03:17,197 --> 00:03:18,280
What?

9
00:03:18,281 --> 00:03:19,908
You're very cheerful today.

10
00:03:21,284 --> 00:03:22,285
How do I look?

11
00:03:24,413 --> 00:03:26,164
Dashing, my lord.

12
00:03:52,649 --> 00:03:55,110
There still hasn't been
any news from the palace.

13
00:03:55,819 --> 00:03:57,653
What on earth is going on?

14
00:03:57,654 --> 00:03:59,406
Maybe something serious has occurred.

15
00:04:01,825 --> 00:04:03,201
A guest has arrived from the palace.

16
00:04:11,209 --> 00:04:12,794
Why did you come here in person?

17
00:04:13,378 --> 00:04:15,630
I came alone
because I need to talk in secrecy.

18
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:26,475
My absence could get noticed,
so I don't have very long.

19
00:04:27,058 --> 00:04:29,060
Where is the Crimson Ring?
Did you find it?

20
00:04:29,811 --> 00:04:30,812
I need to know.

21
00:04:31,521 --> 00:04:34,023
Kosair has it,
according to what Lotteshu says.

22
00:04:34,024 --> 00:04:35,816
But I couldn't confirm it.

23
00:04:35,817 --> 00:04:38,694
His Majesty's knights kept
such a tight watch over Kosair

24
00:04:38,695 --> 00:04:40,655
that approaching him was impossible.

25
00:04:44,993 --> 00:04:47,203
Shall I search for a fake?

26
00:04:47,204 --> 00:04:48,789
Or have a replica made?

27
00:04:49,331 --> 00:04:51,874
No, His Majesty buys a lot of jewelry.

28
00:04:51,875 --> 00:04:53,710
He'd spot a replica for sure.

29
00:04:58,173 --> 00:04:59,341
I'll take care of it.

30
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:05,471
Where can I find Lotteshu now?

31
00:05:05,472 --> 00:05:07,097
He's locked in the outhouse.

32
00:05:07,098 --> 00:05:11,352
I need to figure out what to do
with that little rat of a man as it is.

33
00:05:11,353 --> 00:05:13,146
We can't lock him up here forever.

34
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:15,690
Though he'd pose a risk free.

35
00:05:26,910 --> 00:05:27,994
I…

36
00:05:32,666 --> 00:05:34,042
shall take the throne.

37
00:05:46,513 --> 00:05:47,889
What?

38
00:05:49,015 --> 00:05:51,768
I, Rashta,
shall be the Emperor's new wife.

39
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:56,064
His Majesty's planning to get divorced.

40
00:05:56,773 --> 00:05:59,150
And the next empress-in-line is Rashta.

41
00:06:02,237 --> 00:06:03,446
Good heavens.

42
00:06:03,947 --> 00:06:05,490
Good heavens!

43
00:06:08,451 --> 00:06:11,454
Do not utter a word of this to anyone.

44
00:06:12,247 --> 00:06:14,124
Not until proceedings have begun.

45
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:18,336
You breathe a word to anybody,
and it might be ruined.

46
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,131
His Majesty is rushing everything.

47
00:06:21,715 --> 00:06:25,010
The divorce will go through,
and Empress Navier will yield.

48
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,762
Then he will place Rashta on the throne

49
00:06:28,346 --> 00:06:31,099
so the child's born in wedlock
as a royal heir.

50
00:06:34,269 --> 00:06:35,519
Well, then, uh…

51
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,022
Um, what do we have to do now?

52
00:06:39,357 --> 00:06:40,692
Take care of Lotteshu.

53
00:06:42,027 --> 00:06:43,819
He has latched his teeth into me

54
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:45,863
with the intention of sucking me dry.

55
00:06:45,864 --> 00:06:47,866
This will make it far worse.

56
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,993
He'll suck…

57
00:06:50,994 --> 00:06:52,037
suck…

58
00:06:53,163 --> 00:06:55,624
suck until there's nothing left
for me to give at all.

59
00:06:57,208 --> 00:06:58,501
Say what you mean.

60
00:07:00,003 --> 00:07:01,004
He has to die.

61
00:07:02,922 --> 00:07:04,382
And your son?

62
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:13,350
He cannot…

63
00:07:14,351 --> 00:07:15,518
stay alive.

64
00:07:18,605 --> 00:07:20,398
Neither can the child's father.

65
00:07:22,609 --> 00:07:23,735
It's better…

66
00:07:25,445 --> 00:07:28,156
if we can wipe them out
and just make a clean start.

67
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:32,369
I wonder if Grandpa's coming today.

68
00:07:32,952 --> 00:07:34,371
Why hasn't he been in touch?

69
00:07:35,163 --> 00:07:36,914
You're looking more and more like Rashta.

70
00:07:39,626 --> 00:07:40,627
That must be Grandpa.

71
00:07:41,211 --> 00:07:42,420
Let's go and see.

72
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,993
Back for some more, huh?

73
00:08:26,589 --> 00:08:28,424
Goodness, you're adorable.

74
00:08:28,425 --> 00:08:29,925
Aw!

75
00:08:29,926 --> 00:08:31,136
Come on.

76
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:49,571
<i>"The things that should not be
in this world have disappeared."</i>

77
00:09:30,445 --> 00:09:32,113
This is the divorce application.

78
00:09:34,657 --> 00:09:35,658
Norayu.

79
00:09:37,077 --> 00:09:38,410
Write this.

80
00:09:38,411 --> 00:09:41,747
"Firstly, Kosair Lilder Trovi,
the Empress' brother,

81
00:09:41,748 --> 00:09:44,458
"attempted to murder
the Emperor's child by pushing Rashta,

82
00:09:44,459 --> 00:09:46,585
"causing her to fall
whilst she was pregnant.

83
00:09:46,586 --> 00:09:48,545
"Secondly, in order to unveil

84
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:50,839
"the secrets of Rashta,
the Emperor's mistress,

85
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,801
"the Empress had her brother imprison
and torture an innocent man

86
00:09:53,802 --> 00:09:55,636
"to coerce false statements from him.

87
00:09:55,637 --> 00:09:56,720
"Note that the Empress,

88
00:09:56,721 --> 00:09:58,972
"who may be regarded
as being involved in the incident,

89
00:09:58,973 --> 00:10:02,935
"showed no remorse and was openly hostile
towards the unborn child.

90
00:10:02,936 --> 00:10:04,228
- "Thirdly--"
- Please!

91
00:10:04,229 --> 00:10:06,605
Majesty, you must discuss this
with the Empress.

92
00:10:06,606 --> 00:10:08,565
If you proceed so abruptly like this,

93
00:10:08,566 --> 00:10:11,902
Her Majesty will inevitably
be immensely shocked and hurt.

94
00:10:11,903 --> 00:10:13,196
The risk, Lante,

95
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:16,449
is that the Empress could try
to prevent the divorce.

96
00:10:20,453 --> 00:10:24,206
This remarriage has to take place
well before the baby is here.

97
00:10:24,207 --> 00:10:27,127
I have to secure the bloodline
now there's an heir.

98
00:10:28,128 --> 00:10:30,003
We have no time to waste quibbling.

99
00:10:30,004 --> 00:10:31,588
This lawsuit cannot drag on.

100
00:10:31,589 --> 00:10:35,301
We must make sure we have all the evidence
to bring her to defeat rapidly.

101
00:10:36,386 --> 00:10:37,970
Collect all the records you can

102
00:10:37,971 --> 00:10:40,722
and personal declarations
from the witnesses.

103
00:10:40,723 --> 00:10:42,724
Make the statements clear.

104
00:10:42,725 --> 00:10:44,144
Yes, Your Majesty.

105
00:11:06,374 --> 00:11:07,709
I present Duke Riverty.

106
00:11:08,293 --> 00:11:10,127
Duke Riverty, it is a pleasure.

107
00:11:10,128 --> 00:11:13,006
It is an honor to meet you, Your Majesty.

108
00:11:15,508 --> 00:11:16,842
This is Marquess Amares.

109
00:11:16,843 --> 00:11:18,970
News of your garden has traveled.

110
00:11:19,470 --> 00:11:21,471
I understand it is most beautiful.

111
00:11:21,472 --> 00:11:22,973
It must be a peaceful place.

112
00:11:22,974 --> 00:11:24,308
How did you know that?

113
00:11:24,309 --> 00:11:26,019
Please, make sure to visit.

114
00:11:28,479 --> 00:11:30,607
How do you even know that type of thing?

115
00:11:40,074 --> 00:11:42,160
The late king's widow,
Krista, Your Majesty.

116
00:11:48,249 --> 00:11:50,126
You have my heartfelt sympathy.

117
00:11:51,586 --> 00:11:53,462
Thank you for coming to visit us.

118
00:11:53,463 --> 00:11:54,505
I welcome you.

119
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,851
Duke Zemensia.

120
00:12:07,644 --> 00:12:10,188
We met at the negotiation summit events.

121
00:12:10,813 --> 00:12:13,148
I vividly remember your wise words.

122
00:12:13,149 --> 00:12:14,441
You moved us.

123
00:12:14,442 --> 00:12:15,860
Such a sense of compassion.

124
00:12:16,819 --> 00:12:18,655
The king is grieving at present.

125
00:12:19,239 --> 00:12:22,575
He may be inexperienced
and unprepared for what's ahead.

126
00:12:25,411 --> 00:12:29,249
But our Council of Elders
is going to steer him well.

127
00:12:32,585 --> 00:12:33,795
Duke Zemensia.

128
00:12:34,587 --> 00:12:35,964
I politely disagree.

129
00:12:37,507 --> 00:12:40,885
The Eastern Empire has strong faith
in King Heinrey's abilities.

130
00:12:48,309 --> 00:12:49,310
Mmm-hmm.

131
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:58,568
For inviting me to attend your coronation,

132
00:12:58,569 --> 00:13:00,488
I must express my thanks.

133
00:13:06,995 --> 00:13:09,538
At the Eastern Empire's
recent New Year's Ceremony,

134
00:13:09,539 --> 00:13:11,581
King Heinrey was present

135
00:13:11,582 --> 00:13:14,085
and showed himself
an impressive statesman.

136
00:13:14,836 --> 00:13:15,837
Furthermore…

137
00:13:16,587 --> 00:13:18,089
he showed me what friendship means.

138
00:13:19,590 --> 00:13:22,718
I have received many reports
that trade between our kingdoms

139
00:13:22,719 --> 00:13:25,220
is expected to increase significantly.

140
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:26,472
These agreements…

141
00:13:27,473 --> 00:13:30,018
were formed on the power
of your king's diplomacy.

142
00:13:30,727 --> 00:13:33,229
Our futures are shared for mutual good…

143
00:13:35,023 --> 00:13:37,150
with your king as an important partner.

144
00:13:42,905 --> 00:13:46,199
All of the new trade policies
that you implemented in the East

145
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,577
are now in force in our kingdom too.

146
00:13:48,578 --> 00:13:50,037
Please know this.

147
00:13:50,038 --> 00:13:53,999
Empress Navier, you are always held
in high esteem in our kingdom.

148
00:15:00,066 --> 00:15:01,400
Can't sleep either?

149
00:15:07,031 --> 00:15:08,699
Why do you look so thoughtful?

150
00:15:09,283 --> 00:15:10,743
And what's in your thoughts?

151
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:14,287
Are you worried about your coronation?

152
00:15:14,288 --> 00:15:15,664
I promise the crown will fit.

153
00:15:18,709 --> 00:15:20,336
I was more worried for you.

154
00:15:22,130 --> 00:15:23,797
You must have found things hard

155
00:15:23,798 --> 00:15:25,967
since you heard
that Rashta was with child.

156
00:15:26,509 --> 00:15:28,219
I wondered how you were doing.

157
00:15:29,178 --> 00:15:31,179
I hope it is not too painful for you.

158
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:33,599
Or that it creates
political complications.

159
00:15:34,725 --> 00:15:36,977
That is the nature

160
00:15:36,978 --> 00:15:38,312
of a royal court.

161
00:15:44,152 --> 00:15:45,695
Did I assume too much?

162
00:15:48,698 --> 00:15:49,949
Sovieshu…

163
00:15:50,950 --> 00:15:52,577
wants us to get divorced

164
00:15:53,995 --> 00:15:56,164
and intends to take Rashta as his wife.

165
00:15:58,124 --> 00:16:00,709
I overheard their conversation.

166
00:16:00,710 --> 00:16:01,836
<i>What do you mean, a divorce?</i>

167
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,339
Exactly that.

168
00:16:07,508 --> 00:16:09,427
So what is going to happen next?

169
00:16:10,887 --> 00:16:12,847
I mean to divorce the Empress.

170
00:16:13,514 --> 00:16:15,224
<i>My husband's voice…</i>

171
00:16:15,725 --> 00:16:17,685
was so full of affection,

172
00:16:19,812 --> 00:16:22,064
and Rashta was bursting with joy.

173
00:16:58,017 --> 00:17:00,061
I'm so grateful to see you.

174
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,648
I've missed you.

175
00:17:06,067 --> 00:17:07,485
That's why I came here.

176
00:18:41,287 --> 00:18:42,412
Thank you.

177
00:18:42,413 --> 00:18:43,873
I will not wear the crown.

178
00:19:09,607 --> 00:19:11,316
All winds are born in the West.

179
00:19:11,317 --> 00:19:13,652
They start in our valleys and mountains.

180
00:19:13,653 --> 00:19:15,237
Our kingdom is their origin.

181
00:19:16,697 --> 00:19:17,781
Remember,

182
00:19:17,782 --> 00:19:20,075
those winds are the very source of life,

183
00:19:20,076 --> 00:19:21,494
soaring across every land.

184
00:19:22,244 --> 00:19:24,538
It brings life and breath to the world.

185
00:19:26,832 --> 00:19:28,667
King Walton III, my older brother,

186
00:19:28,668 --> 00:19:30,293
his dream lives on.

187
00:19:30,294 --> 00:19:32,671
He wanted to share the ideals
of the Western Kingdom

188
00:19:32,672 --> 00:19:34,006
just like those winds.

189
00:19:35,966 --> 00:19:36,967
Now…

190
00:19:38,135 --> 00:19:40,846
I will commit to that great dream of his
and bring it to life.

191
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:45,810
The winds will blow
with the air of promise.

192
00:19:47,103 --> 00:19:49,188
Winds of change spreading everywhere.

193
00:19:50,398 --> 00:19:52,023
They will carry the vital truth

194
00:19:52,024 --> 00:19:54,025
that all people are born equal.

195
00:19:54,026 --> 00:19:57,362
We are born free, and the collective will
of all our children

196
00:19:57,363 --> 00:19:58,823
is an almighty one.

197
00:19:59,824 --> 00:20:01,117
That day is near.

198
00:20:01,742 --> 00:20:03,243
And on that day,

199
00:20:03,244 --> 00:20:05,204
we will see our kingdom born again

200
00:20:05,788 --> 00:20:08,040
as an empire.

201
00:20:09,083 --> 00:20:10,793
And I will stand there with you.

202
00:20:12,211 --> 00:20:13,837
Will we all stand together?

203
00:20:16,507 --> 00:20:18,800
Long live the Western Kingdom!

204
00:20:18,801 --> 00:20:20,845
Long live King Heinrey!

205
00:20:31,272 --> 00:20:32,314
I swear…

206
00:20:33,315 --> 00:20:35,067
that dream will come to life.

207
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:38,195
Without fail.

208
00:20:39,363 --> 00:20:41,281
Long live King Heinrey,

209
00:20:41,282 --> 00:20:42,407
my king!

210
00:20:42,408 --> 00:20:45,577
Long live King Heinrey, my king!

211
00:20:45,578 --> 00:20:49,122
Long live King Heinrey, my king!

212
00:20:50,499 --> 00:20:52,459
Long live King Heinrey, my king!

213
00:20:52,460 --> 00:20:56,337
Long live King Heinrey, my king!

214
00:20:56,338 --> 00:20:59,467
Long live King Heinrey, my king!

215
00:21:03,763 --> 00:21:06,390
I would be delighted
if you greeted the audience below.

216
00:21:08,309 --> 00:21:11,936
Our people would be truly delighted
if Your Majesty was able.

217
00:21:11,937 --> 00:21:13,397
It would show your support for the king.

218
00:21:32,958 --> 00:21:34,335
You will get used to it.

219
00:22:08,786 --> 00:22:09,787
Navier…

220
00:22:22,341 --> 00:22:23,759
A king needs a queen.

221
00:22:36,188 --> 00:22:37,773
Navier, I want to marry you.

222
00:23:21,191 --> 00:23:22,234
Yes, Heinrey.

223
00:23:24,153 --> 00:23:25,654
I will be your queen.

224
00:23:48,844 --> 00:23:50,470
You can contact me…

225
00:23:50,471 --> 00:23:51,680
if you need anything.

226
00:23:55,184 --> 00:23:56,267
I will write to you.

227
00:23:56,268 --> 00:23:57,603
Mmm.

228
00:24:11,617 --> 00:24:13,118
This way.

229
00:24:18,165 --> 00:24:19,166
Oh!

230
00:24:20,542 --> 00:24:21,918
They were…

231
00:24:21,919 --> 00:24:24,004
such an attractive married couple.

232
00:24:25,798 --> 00:24:26,840
Sir?

233
00:24:28,175 --> 00:24:29,468
When they were young,

234
00:24:30,135 --> 00:24:32,429
they were the most beautiful children.

235
00:24:35,265 --> 00:24:39,687
<i>Please allow light to reach
even the coldest and darkest of places.</i>

236
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:41,980
Please let the two of us

237
00:24:41,981 --> 00:24:44,649
become this empire's strongest pillars,

238
00:24:44,650 --> 00:24:47,987
and let us always be
at its ever-loving heart.

239
00:24:55,452 --> 00:24:57,371
I pray that Navier's wish is granted.

240
00:25:01,250 --> 00:25:03,292
Please let her great wisdom

241
00:25:03,293 --> 00:25:04,628
be a path for the nation.

242
00:25:05,796 --> 00:25:07,589
And give me the strength to defend it.

243
00:25:08,340 --> 00:25:09,591
Let us be one…

244
00:25:10,634 --> 00:25:13,637
and proud to be at each other's side
always and forever.

245
00:25:30,112 --> 00:25:32,739
The two of them have never been apart,

246
00:25:32,740 --> 00:25:35,242
not even for a moment since childhood.

247
00:25:36,827 --> 00:25:39,288
It always seemed ordained by the gods.

248
00:25:41,665 --> 00:25:42,874
The war…

249
00:25:42,875 --> 00:25:44,168
conflicts…

250
00:25:45,002 --> 00:25:46,961
They helped us through that darkness,

251
00:25:46,962 --> 00:25:49,173
brought us all together,
and made us better.

252
00:25:50,924 --> 00:25:52,676
They worked with each other.

253
00:25:54,553 --> 00:25:56,138
Building this great empire…

254
00:25:56,764 --> 00:25:58,265
as one.

255
00:26:03,604 --> 00:26:06,482
And… now a divorce.

256
00:26:10,360 --> 00:26:12,279
I feel that maybe I let them down.

257
00:26:34,426 --> 00:26:35,427
Uh…

258
00:26:40,224 --> 00:26:41,642
I used to have this book.

259
00:26:42,893 --> 00:26:45,062
My mother read it aloud when I was young.

260
00:26:46,021 --> 00:26:47,689
Our child would love this book.

261
00:26:48,774 --> 00:26:50,734
Do you think it would recall
if I read it now?

262
00:26:51,819 --> 00:26:52,945
Indeed.

263
00:26:54,029 --> 00:26:56,572
The child will surely be as clever as me,

264
00:26:56,573 --> 00:26:57,950
so it should work.

265
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,084
I told you to always wear
that Crimson Ring.

266
00:27:09,837 --> 00:27:10,921
The truth is…

267
00:27:11,964 --> 00:27:13,256
it is not here.

268
00:27:13,257 --> 00:27:14,341
My maid lost it.

269
00:27:15,425 --> 00:27:16,468
Really?

270
00:27:17,261 --> 00:27:18,262
Which one?

271
00:27:19,555 --> 00:27:21,264
Please do not be cross.

272
00:27:21,265 --> 00:27:24,434
Here and now,
I must keep positive thoughts in my head.

273
00:27:25,185 --> 00:27:26,769
My body has recovered,

274
00:27:26,770 --> 00:27:28,897
and the girl cried all night.

275
00:27:29,731 --> 00:27:31,649
She felt so guilty about losing the ring.

276
00:27:35,279 --> 00:27:37,614
It is marvelous how kind you are.

277
00:27:43,370 --> 00:27:44,663
I just felt a kick.

278
00:27:45,163 --> 00:27:47,332
But that means
your child wants to meet you.

279
00:27:48,250 --> 00:27:49,751
Place your ear down here.

280
00:28:12,149 --> 00:28:15,318
I will take a while to hear both sides.

281
00:28:15,319 --> 00:28:16,736
What the Emperor will say,

282
00:28:16,737 --> 00:28:19,531
but also, I want to hear
the viewpoint of the Empress.

283
00:28:20,657 --> 00:28:24,912
I have some really rather grave news
to deliver.

284
00:28:27,539 --> 00:28:29,415
It concerns divorce.

285
00:28:29,416 --> 00:28:31,501
A divorce which the Emperor has demanded.

286
00:28:42,596 --> 00:28:44,056
Had you already known?

287
00:28:45,182 --> 00:28:46,642
I had my suspicions.

288
00:28:47,643 --> 00:28:48,726
I see.

289
00:28:48,727 --> 00:28:50,228
So how did this happen?

290
00:28:51,355 --> 00:28:53,774
The two of you were special,
or so it seemed.

291
00:28:55,233 --> 00:28:57,026
But the house of cards tumbled down.

292
00:28:57,027 --> 00:28:58,195
Hmm.

293
00:28:59,404 --> 00:29:00,488
The Emperor

294
00:29:00,489 --> 00:29:03,366
believes your brother's crime
is extremely serious

295
00:29:03,367 --> 00:29:07,411
and that he is a grave threat
and a danger to this unborn child.

296
00:29:07,412 --> 00:29:09,456
Even if this marriage ends,

297
00:29:09,998 --> 00:29:12,250
I refuse to agree
that the cause was my brother.

298
00:29:13,043 --> 00:29:17,089
Why did you two grow apart so rapidly?

299
00:29:18,674 --> 00:29:21,134
My husband's heart
was taken by another love.

300
00:29:23,512 --> 00:29:24,846
That is what happened.

301
00:29:25,639 --> 00:29:27,557
Mmm-hmm. I do consider…

302
00:29:30,185 --> 00:29:33,647
this case to be
of the utmost importance, but…

303
00:29:37,192 --> 00:29:38,318
you should not…

304
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:42,572
just accept this as inevitable.

305
00:29:43,407 --> 00:29:44,741
Do you understand?

306
00:29:53,417 --> 00:29:56,002
This is preposterous!
How could they do this?

307
00:30:00,507 --> 00:30:01,590
Your Majesty,

308
00:30:01,591 --> 00:30:04,469
His Majesty has convened
an emergency council.

309
00:30:08,682 --> 00:30:10,307
I know what he's doing.

310
00:30:10,308 --> 00:30:12,727
He wants the divorce
to become a public event.

311
00:30:12,728 --> 00:30:15,229
Your Majesty, I beg you not to appear.

312
00:30:15,230 --> 00:30:17,941
No, I beseech you. Your Majesty, don't go.

313
00:30:18,650 --> 00:30:20,527
It doesn't matter if I attend court.

314
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:22,446
Without me,

315
00:30:23,905 --> 00:30:25,407
the divorce will still go ahead.

316
00:31:51,159 --> 00:31:53,578
I really am sorry, Navier.

317
00:31:55,372 --> 00:31:56,455
However--

318
00:31:56,456 --> 00:31:58,125
I do not want apologies.

319
00:31:58,667 --> 00:32:00,377
From you, they are empty.

320
00:32:01,419 --> 00:32:02,879
Please do not even try.

321
00:32:04,047 --> 00:32:06,216
May I present the Court Magistrate.

322
00:32:26,486 --> 00:32:27,529
Gentlemen…

323
00:32:29,239 --> 00:32:30,657
Empress Navier and I…

324
00:32:31,658 --> 00:32:33,243
are getting a divorce.

325
00:32:37,497 --> 00:32:40,332
Please, Your Majesty.
Divorce? This is not right.

326
00:32:40,333 --> 00:32:41,834
What the Chancellor says is right.

327
00:32:41,835 --> 00:32:43,586
This can't be.

328
00:32:43,587 --> 00:32:45,171
This needs reconsidering.

329
00:32:47,841 --> 00:32:49,759
-  Please, think of the Empire!
- Quiet.

330
00:32:51,344 --> 00:32:52,596
It has been decided already.

331
00:32:55,015 --> 00:32:56,850
The court must commence…

332
00:32:58,727 --> 00:33:00,769
after five days

333
00:33:00,770 --> 00:33:01,771
of preparation.

334
00:33:23,710 --> 00:33:26,128
<i>"I never imagined
that the divorce proceedings</i>

335
00:33:26,129 --> 00:33:27,589
<i>"would move this quickly.</i>

336
00:33:31,009 --> 00:33:33,844
<i>"By the time this letter reaches you,</i>

337
00:33:33,845 --> 00:33:36,640
<i>"I will likely be standing
in the divorce court.</i>

338
00:33:38,683 --> 00:33:42,187
<i>"I cannot predict what judgment
the Court Magistrate will make,</i>

339
00:33:43,230 --> 00:33:45,023
<i>"but I intend to stand firm.</i>

340
00:33:46,608 --> 00:33:49,319
<i>"Please pray
that I will not be too lonely."</i>

341
00:34:01,122 --> 00:34:02,414
What time will the trial be?

342
00:34:02,415 --> 00:34:03,708
At noon tomorrow.

343
00:34:04,334 --> 00:34:05,543
At noon.

344
00:34:39,077 --> 00:34:40,536
Today is our last chance.

345
00:34:40,537 --> 00:34:42,288
Proceed with it all quickly.

346
00:34:42,289 --> 00:34:43,872
If we fail to complete this,

347
00:34:43,873 --> 00:34:46,125
it will leave these people stranded.

348
00:34:46,126 --> 00:34:47,418
Yes, my lady.

349
00:34:47,419 --> 00:34:51,255
Now, let us start with grouping
all of the separate budgets.

350
00:34:51,256 --> 00:34:54,550
Ensure there is funding
for schools, hospitals, orphanages,

351
00:34:54,551 --> 00:34:55,968
and war widows' pensions.

352
00:34:55,969 --> 00:34:57,304
Yes, Your Majesty.

353
00:35:08,064 --> 00:35:09,773
Have I reached the last one?

354
00:35:09,774 --> 00:35:11,275
You have, Your Majesty.

355
00:35:11,276 --> 00:35:14,154
SIGNATURE

356
00:35:24,414 --> 00:35:25,957
I had been concentrating,

357
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:28,668
so I had not quite realized

358
00:35:29,628 --> 00:35:30,670
you were all here.

359
00:35:41,806 --> 00:35:43,141
My bequests are signed…

360
00:35:44,225 --> 00:35:45,518
including this.

361
00:35:46,853 --> 00:35:48,772
All of my assets are to go to you.

362
00:35:49,481 --> 00:35:50,898
You all did your very best

363
00:35:50,899 --> 00:35:52,483
for this empire.

364
00:35:52,484 --> 00:35:54,402
And it wasn't always easy.

365
00:35:55,362 --> 00:35:56,780
And that was my doing.

366
00:35:57,739 --> 00:35:59,323
In spite of it all,

367
00:35:59,324 --> 00:36:00,659
you always showed me love.

368
00:36:01,534 --> 00:36:03,036
I give my thanks to you…

369
00:36:04,621 --> 00:36:07,415
for your unwavering patience
and your compassion.

370
00:36:09,751 --> 00:36:11,169
You mean so much to me.

371
00:36:12,128 --> 00:36:14,673
Now you can live your lives
however you choose to.

372
00:36:20,929 --> 00:36:22,013
To be with you

373
00:36:22,889 --> 00:36:24,057
was an honor for me.

374
00:36:25,892 --> 00:36:28,645
I will forever treasure our time together.

375
00:36:30,772 --> 00:36:33,066
I've been so happy.

376
00:38:19,506 --> 00:38:20,673
I shall do it.

377
00:39:55,852 --> 00:39:59,521
His Majesty Emperor Sovieshu Trovi Victor!

378
00:39:59,522 --> 00:40:02,567
Her Majesty Empress Navier Ellie Trovi!

379
00:41:11,552 --> 00:41:13,470
We will hear the divorce suit

380
00:41:13,471 --> 00:41:17,224
filed by the Emperor
Sovieshu Trovi Victor.

381
00:41:17,225 --> 00:41:20,019
The trial will now begin.

382
00:41:22,897 --> 00:41:25,775
Both parties,
has your legal counsel been chosen?

383
00:41:28,236 --> 00:41:29,861
I have selected

384
00:41:29,862 --> 00:41:32,115
Marquess Lante for legal counsel.

385
00:41:33,741 --> 00:41:35,701
Is that all their evidence?

386
00:41:35,702 --> 00:41:36,703
Oh my goodness.

387
00:41:37,620 --> 00:41:40,956
They are absolutely set
on destroying the Empress.

388
00:41:44,752 --> 00:41:45,878
Empress…

389
00:41:47,005 --> 00:41:48,756
appoint your legal counsel.

390
00:41:54,762 --> 00:41:55,847
Your Honor…

391
00:41:57,557 --> 00:42:00,226
I have chosen not to appoint anyone.

392
00:42:03,604 --> 00:42:04,605
I will not…

393
00:42:06,649 --> 00:42:08,066
be contesting the divorce.

394
00:42:12,238 --> 00:42:14,614
Do not be rash!
Stand firm, please, you must!

395
00:42:14,615 --> 00:42:15,907
You must fight this, Your Majesty.

396
00:42:15,908 --> 00:42:18,493
Why must Her Majesty
have this inflicted upon her?

397
00:42:18,494 --> 00:42:20,579
Are you saying His Majesty
is the only one at fault here?

398
00:42:20,580 --> 00:42:21,997
Everyone, be quiet.

399
00:42:21,998 --> 00:42:23,582
Silence!

400
00:42:24,709 --> 00:42:27,336
Empress Navier,

401
00:42:28,004 --> 00:42:32,257
so do you agree
to this formal divorce document

402
00:42:32,258 --> 00:42:33,718
without any objection?

403
00:42:35,178 --> 00:42:37,346
I accept the divorce.

404
00:42:45,980 --> 00:42:47,148
And I request…

405
00:43:00,286 --> 00:43:04,831
an approval of my remarriage.

406
00:43:04,832 --> 00:43:06,458
Remarry?

407
00:43:06,459 --> 00:43:09,002
Did I just hear that correctly?

408
00:43:14,342 --> 00:43:15,593
Uh, Empress…

409
00:43:16,260 --> 00:43:19,514
did… did you say you want to remarry?

410
00:43:20,932 --> 00:43:23,267
Your Honor, may I step forward?

411
00:43:38,616 --> 00:43:39,784
I am here.

412
00:44:18,906 --> 00:44:20,575
Sorry to leave you alone.

413
00:44:28,583 --> 00:44:30,209
He is the one I will remarry.

414
00:44:39,927 --> 00:44:41,846
I, King Heinrey, have come here…

415
00:44:43,181 --> 00:44:44,639
for Lady Navier.

416
00:44:44,640 --> 00:44:46,184
It is my wish to make her my queen.

417
00:44:47,643 --> 00:44:49,352
I know this must be sudden,

418
00:44:49,353 --> 00:44:50,854
but in light of the circumstances,

419
00:44:50,855 --> 00:44:52,564
please approve our remarriage

420
00:44:52,565 --> 00:44:54,275
and grant us your endorsement.

421
00:44:57,195 --> 00:44:58,196
I truly,

422
00:44:59,030 --> 00:45:00,531
earnestly implore you.

423
00:45:45,284 --> 00:45:48,828
The divorce filed
by Emperor Sovieshu Trovi Victor

424
00:45:48,829 --> 00:45:50,373
in this court…

425
00:45:55,086 --> 00:45:56,671
is now approved.

426
00:45:59,423 --> 00:46:01,383
With this divorce finalized,

427
00:46:01,384 --> 00:46:03,677
Navier Ellie Trovi

428
00:46:03,678 --> 00:46:08,181
is now no longer
the Eastern Empire's Empress.

429
00:46:08,182 --> 00:46:10,350
Therefore, her request to remarry

430
00:46:10,351 --> 00:46:14,647
with His Majesty King Heinrey
is also approved.

431
00:46:43,050 --> 00:46:44,468
I forbid this.

432
00:46:54,895 --> 00:46:56,731
I cannot let this happen.

433
00:47:16,125 --> 00:47:21,922
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS
